        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "(3) EXCLUSIVE PROVIDER ARRANGEMENT (EPA) – EPA's are managed care plans that are funded by the Company. When these plans are offered to employees (as part of a Flexible Benefits Plan) and retirees, the terms and conditions of these plans will be determined by the Company. The existing one and a half million ($1,500,000) dollar life time limit will be applicable and transferable between self-funded plans.",
