        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "(4) VISION PLAN – Effective January 1, 1999 the Company will make provisions for employees and their eligible dependents to be covered by a Vision Plan. For the term of this contract, the Company will pay 50% of the cost of this plan.",
